  "common-default-rails/sine": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: floating_pin Q1.E\n* issue: invalid_value x\n* issue: floating_pin x.A\n* issue: floating_pin x.K\n* issue: value_out_of_range R1\n* issue: floating_pin R1.K\n* issue: duplicate_name x\n* issue: value_out_of_range x\n* issue: floating_pin C1.D\n* issue: floating_pin C1.S\n* issue: value_out_of_range U1\n* issue: floating_pin U1.A\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\nQ1 n1 0 n2 QPNP\nDx n3 n4 DZ_Dx\nDR1 0 n5 DZ_DR1\nRx n1 0 1e+20\nMC1 n6 0 n7 n7 NMOSD\nDU1 n8 0 DZ_DU1\n.model DZ_DR1 D(IS=1e-14 BV=1e-7 IBV=1e-3)\n.model DZ_DU1 D(IS=1e-14 BV=1e+20 IBV=1e-3)\n.model DZ_Dx D(IS=1e-14 BV=5.1e+0 IBV=1e-3)\n.model NMOSD NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=-1 KP=1e-3)\n.model QPNP PNP(BF=100)\nVin in 0 SIN(5e-1 1e+0 1e+3)\nRload out outl 1e+12\nVmeas outl 0 0\n.tran 1e-5 5e-3 0\n.control\nset wr_vecnames\nset wr_singlescale\nrun\nlinearize v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\nwrdata /dev/stdout v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\n.endc\n.end\n",
